    "body": "> juxtaposition is a suggestive means to illustrate this\r\n\r\nIt's not a valid one according to Infra, though. You can use words, like \"concatenated with\". Or you can just do the concatenation yourself. You cannot just put two things next to each other and assume that people understand that means concatenation.",
