    "created_at": "2020-10-05T08:07:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-10-05T08:07:35Z",
    "body": "We already have quotes appearing inside strings, e.g., https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#example-header-list-get-decode-split. I wouldn't mind trying to emphasize the difference more between what's inside and outside though.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure I understand the other problem. Unless something is explained to have meaning, it doesn't.",
